---
import Tunnel from '../../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
import Choice from '../../../components/Choice.astro';
---
<Tunnel title="Headphone Jack | Save My Gig!" status="No_Sound · Headphones" red>
  <div class="step-label">Now the jack</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Now the jack</h2>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Push the plug in firmly. Half-inserted is the classic.</li>
    <li>Try the other headphone socket if the mixer has more than one.</li>
    <li>Try the adapter the other way, or someone else's headphones.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="tunnel-note" style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    You can mix without cue if you have to. Long blends, tracks you know.
  </p>

  <p class="question">Hearing it now?</p>

  <Choice step="ns_phones2"
    a={{ href: '/saved?path=no_sound&branch=jack', label: 'YES, I HEAR IT', event: 'outcome_reached', data: { outcome: 'saved', path: 'no_sound' } }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/no-sound/fallback', label: 'NO, STILL NOTHING' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
